Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}本字幕來源互聯網  原製作者： 漫游字幕组
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:10.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}感謝字幕組及製作字幕個人的辛勤勞動與付出
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:15.00,Default SEED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fad(500,500)}字幕由kewenyu重新製作以適應重製版
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.06,0:00:11.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.90,0:00:17.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,識別編號285002特種部隊FAITH所屬阿斯蘭 薩拉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:18.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,請給予登艦許可
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:24.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼你會是...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:28.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我之前雖然也比較尊敬她
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:29.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,卡嘉莉 尤拉 阿斯哈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.83,0:00:32.34,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但實在太失望了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.26,0:00:35.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,先和大西洋聯邦簽訂同盟
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:38.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,還和古怪的傢伙結婚
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.22,0:00:40.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結婚？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:47.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓你回到FAITH，並為本艦配置了最新型機體
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.17,0:00:50.62,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,而且連我也成了FAITH？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.35,0:00:56.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,議長到底在想什麼　還有你也是...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.91,0:01:04.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼拉古號出發
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:09.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva出擊　微速前進
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.93,0:01:16.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和基拉一起的話應該不要緊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.69,0:01:19.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,反正也回不了奧布
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.98,0:01:29.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,終於見面了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.71,0:01:31.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你了　小貓咪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚く散った光が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び覚ます
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,悲しみは音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,消えるあの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,深く愛する
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,勇氣と希望強く
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,感じるこの記憶が
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,絡み合う心と
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ココロをつないで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,動き出している
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,輝く光が照らし
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,僕らを今呼び起こす
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,響きあう音を立て
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,刻むこの場所から
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,永久に信じ続けて…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.12,0:03:07.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,J.P. Jones 09:00出航
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.56,0:03:09.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令第一戰鬥配置
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.30,0:03:11.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,各整備班　戰鬥狀態準備
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.80,0:03:14.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,突然更換Windam的主推進器？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.56,0:03:16.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Phantom Pain還真胡來
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.33,0:03:19.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出動本部隊所有的Windam？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.18,0:03:21.40,SP SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs34\pos(1088,662)}{\fad(200,300)}地球連合軍 印度洋前線基地
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.24,0:03:21.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胡說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.27,0:03:23.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胡說的人是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.15,0:03:26.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對手可是博茲格羅夫級和Minerva
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.91,0:03:29.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,即使如此都不確定能否擊沉他們
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.85,0:03:33.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之前奧布海域戰役的數據你沒看嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:35.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是這個意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.59,0:03:41.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我們是為了建造能進攻卡潘塔利亞的前線基地 而被派遣來的部隊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:43.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,任務還未完成
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:45.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼可能派出MS給貴艦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.48,0:03:48.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那個基地不也是為了打ZAFT嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.80,0:03:51.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別說夢話了　趕快派出全部MS
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.16,0:03:54.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡的防衛就交給Gaia
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.82,0:03:56.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這　但是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.85,0:03:58.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是命令　趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.29,0:04:00.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Chaos Gaia Abyss呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.14,0:04:03.20,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全機出擊準備完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.73,0:04:06.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好 Jones按兵不動
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.23,0:04:11.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真羨慕大家　只有史黛拉看家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.79,0:04:16.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gaia既不會飛也不會游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:20.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,邊看海一邊乖乖等著吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.15,0:04:22.04,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是喜歡看海嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.12,0:04:26.96,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史黛拉不能出擊我也很遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.25,0:04:29.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.99,0:04:31.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但是沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.84,0:04:33.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然應該不會有什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.18,0:04:34.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,之後就拜託了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.26,0:04:42.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,X24S-Chaos　出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.42,0:04:53.86,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史丁格 奧格雷　Chaos出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:59.54,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧 尼達　Abyss出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.57,0:05:19.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡的Phantom Pain
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,能就此作個了斷就謝天謝地了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:43.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐 羅阿諾克　Windam出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:56.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.39,0:05:59.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.88,0:06:01.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發令紅色狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:03.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,駕駛員到搭乘機待機
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.95,0:06:06.95,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,熱紋對照　是Windam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.54,0:06:08.32,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,數量30
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.80,0:06:09.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,30？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.01,0:06:11.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,其中一機為Chaos
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.83,0:06:14.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是那支部隊嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:15.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,到底從哪來的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.85,0:06:17.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,附近有母艦嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.35,0:06:19.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,無法確認
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.41,0:06:22.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又是海市蜃樓系統嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.46,0:06:24.71,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在海上？不可能吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.88,0:06:28.48,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒功夫閒扯了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.17,0:06:30.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,艦橋遮蔽
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.53,0:06:32.29,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,對MS戰鬥準備
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.06,0:06:35.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,與尼拉古號線路固定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:38.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,庫拉提斯艦長
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:40.65,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是地球軍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.12,0:06:44.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯　看來又被埋伏了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.04,0:06:47.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,老是這樣　人氣高還真辛苦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.85,0:06:50.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,已經不可能迴避
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.92,0:06:52.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本艦即將進入戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:54.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:58.46,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我無權命令你
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:00.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我也出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.67,0:07:02.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.16,0:07:05.44,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,確實您可能無權指揮我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.98,0:07:08.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我現在也是本艦的搭乘者
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.05,0:07:12.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雖然無奈　我也認為難免一戰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:18.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼希望MS出擊後你能擔任指揮　可以嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.42,0:07:20.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:24.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Impulse  Saviour  請出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:27.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Zaku在另有命令前待機
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:35.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Silhouette機庫1號開放
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.49,0:07:37.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Force Silhouette準備
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.17,0:07:42.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Silhouette Flyer設置於中央彈射器
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.79,0:07:45.10,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,封鎖氣密閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:47.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊急工作人員請待命
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.24,0:07:51.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,中央彈射器啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.76,0:07:53.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,升至發射位置
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:56.38,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,核心戰機全系統啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.82,0:07:58.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,進入發射待機狀態
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.70,0:08:05.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,X23S-Saviour　阿斯蘭機
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.51,0:08:06.49,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊準備
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,全系統啟動確認完畢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.65,0:08:16.16,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,封鎖氣密閘門
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.58,0:08:18.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器準備確認
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.58,0:08:20.42,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.57,0:08:22.19,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:25.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出擊後由我擔任戰鬥指揮
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.06,0:08:27.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:29.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:32.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射系統確認接合
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.90,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,彈射器推力正常
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:36.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,路線無阻
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.15,0:08:39.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,核心戰機　出擊　請
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:43.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真 飛鳥　核心戰機
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.97,0:08:44.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,出動
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.49,0:08:54.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,胸部組件發射　請
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.18,0:09:00.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,腿部組件發射　請
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.84,0:09:06.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Silhouette Flyer發射　請
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.10,0:09:16.30,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,右舷艙門開啟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.73,0:09:18.80,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Saviour出擊　請
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,阿斯蘭 薩拉　Saviour出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.87,0:09:49.79,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵方MS展開
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.28,0:09:52.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,CIWS　Tristan　Isolde啟動
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.82,0:09:55.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射管1 2　全門Parsifal裝填
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.19,0:10:04.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那機體是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.49,0:10:07.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,又是新型機嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.67,0:10:09.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在卡潘塔利亞？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.25,0:10:11.52,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,ZAFT還真厲害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:13.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那種東西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.41,0:10:15.60,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,喂喂　史丁格
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.73,0:10:17.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.25,0:10:20.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,我就對付那個老對頭吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.59,0:10:26.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,只會靠數量纏人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.85,0:10:33.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,來吧 讓我看看你的本事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,新面孔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.02,0:10:50.91,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:58.15,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,哪能輸給這些傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:03.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,原來如此
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:18.03,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡　什麼傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.59,0:11:19.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.06,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別太得意　ZAFT的小王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:31.74,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別發呆
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.14,0:11:33.35,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聯合追擊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:43.14,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.40,0:11:49.88,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真　衝太出去了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.30,0:11:51.51,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:59.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱怨的話　誰都會
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.97,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,發射管1 發射管2　發射
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.44,0:12:08.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.89,0:12:10.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但我們的探測器
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:15.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別說潛水艇　連艘船都沒有發現
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.66,0:12:18.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那您說他們是從哪來的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.99,0:12:20.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道附近有基地？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.58,0:12:24.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在卡潘塔利亞眼皮底下？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.36,0:12:26.81,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,沒得到過那種情報
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.12,0:12:28.70,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,聲納反應　數量1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:29.75,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.94,0:12:30.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:35.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這是MS…Abyss
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.83,0:12:46.47,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓雷和露娜做水中戰的準備
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.94,0:12:48.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,完成後立即出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.05,0:12:49.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.26,0:12:54.78,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,迎擊　GOOhN出擊　趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:03.07,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,光束槍不能用　裝火箭炮
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.30,0:13:04.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.27,0:13:08.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,竟然要打水中戰 真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.67,0:13:23.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡  這傢伙那是什麼動作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.73,0:13:51.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉　我有點強
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.94,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Minerva　剛才那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:08.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Abyss和尼拉古號的GOOhN交戰中
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.20,0:14:10.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但只有一台
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:16.33,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,雷 查 巴勒路　Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.22,0:14:19.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,露娜瑪莉雅 霍克　Zaku出擊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.94,0:14:22.66,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,交給雷和露娜應付
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.21,0:14:24.64,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,敵人的據點呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:26.43,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你們看得到什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.21,0:14:30.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不　這裡也什麼都看不見　不過…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.17,0:14:37.82,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙　只要打下這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.99,0:14:49.01,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,伊莉莎白
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.84,0:14:59.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.64,0:15:14.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡,囂張的傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.15,0:15:19.84,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,用這玩意打我？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.07,0:15:25.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別小看我
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.58,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,比想像的進步還快
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.14,0:15:38.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼 該怎麼做呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.73,0:15:42.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡　那傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.42,0:15:46.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼歐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:54.24,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Gaia
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:03.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.26,0:16:13.77,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙也有一手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.47,0:16:18.40,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.89,0:16:23.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,總是...總是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.96,0:16:35.25,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,史丁格　迂迴
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.95,0:16:44.61,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真　退下　被他們佔上風了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.13,0:16:57.31,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這傢伙 今天一定要...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.49,0:16:59.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.38,0:17:00.85,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,囉嗦 看我的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.54,0:17:07.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,防空炮趕快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:11.36,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,羅阿諾克那傢伙在幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:29.45,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,親愛的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.59,0:17:31.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃到這裡來
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:38.11,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,這次又怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.33,0:17:43.98,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,基地？　這種地方
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.67,0:17:45.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,建設中嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.97,0:17:54.67,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,難道在用這裡的平民…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.41,0:18:06.92,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.10,0:18:09.41,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.10,0:18:36.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,快到極限了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:38.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不是個好舞台啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:42.12,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Jones　撤退　準備會合
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.51,0:18:46.17,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,奧盧　史丁格　史黛拉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:48.39,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了 撤離
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.82,0:18:50.57,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.22,0:18:52.69,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,借來的人全滅了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.24,0:18:55.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,作為預定據點的土地也被卷進去了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.56,0:18:58.37,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,你在搞什麼啊　呆子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.71,0:19:02.73,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,別這麼說,你自己不也沒打下什麼嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.69,0:19:05.23,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那就走著瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.71,0:19:08.55,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:18.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,4點方向地球軍航母
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.64,0:19:21.09,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,正接近尼拉古號
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.93,0:19:32.83,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Abyss接近　距離200
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.88,0:19:36.02,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,左滿舵
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.16,0:19:37.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,引擎最大　迴避
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.76,0:19:39.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不行　來不及
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.88,0:20:13.05,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,尼拉古號…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:16.76,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.00,0:20:41.72,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.44,0:20:47.13,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,在幹什麼　住手
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:49.68,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,他們已經沒戰鬥能力了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:37.27,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,想打的話就打個夠吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.68,0:21:40.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我沒做錯事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:43.18,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡的人也因此得救了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.26,0:21:47.22,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰爭不是英雄遊戲
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.94,0:21:50.93,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,不許獨斷獨行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.34,0:21:54.28,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,擁有能力的人更應該自覺
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,涙で滲んだ  この時空を  見上げるたび
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,儚い蒼さが  胸を締めつけてく
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,運命なら  哀しみの果てまで
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戦い続けた  日々を跡に
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　燃え上がる
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,命がある限り
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,真実の自分さえ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,見失いそう　それでも
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,Life Goes On　守りたくて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,心は砕かれて
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,本当の哀しみを知った瞳は
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,愛に溢れて....
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.53,0:23:26.21,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,為了什麼　為何戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.89,0:23:27.59,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,和誰戰鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.61,0:23:31.63,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,因為相信是正義所以能夠開槍嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.37,0:23:35.26,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,踏上戰場的人誰都會有相同答案
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.05,0:23:39.87,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,但真正知道這樣做後果的人 現在…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.05,0:23:44.08,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,下回 機動戰士GUNDAM SEED DESTINY
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.62,0:23:45.89,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,戰士的條件
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.70,0:23:49.53,Default SEED,NTP,0,0,0,,衝向新的道路　Impulse
